'Find' and 'found' are strongest as finite verbs, especially after 'I';
infinitives, ability questions and passive constructions are weaker.
Related f-vowel-nd spellings also respond across subword boundaries.
Fruit/fur/fut spellings tend to respond negatively. A reduced response
