"""Approximate structural labels in questions, source files, and web pages.

Positive responses mark a Q: label, new groups of import/include declarations,
and short abstract/publication labels. Ordinary text stays near zero. The
small state tracks document starts, blank lines, and earlier code directives;
it never reads later text.
