"""Approximate a document-opening pulse and a split-indentation signal.

The opening pulse depends on broad token classes, not word identity. It lasts
through repetitions of the opening token. Most interior text is silent. A
single space or tab continuing a whitespace token gives a negative pulse;
for spaces this fades with distance into the document. Nonbreaking-space
indentation and adjacent Markdown backticks have similar negative pulses.
